  "model_message": "Good - no trip notices affecting this booking. \n\nNow, here's my plan for this request in JSON format:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"search\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"origin\": \"MUC\",\n        \"to\": \"FRA\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-10-14\",\n        \"cabin\": \"economy\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"select\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"flight\": \"[to be determined from search results]\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"book\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"flight\": \"[same as selected flight]\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"pay_order\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"order_id\": \"[to be determined from booking]\",\n        \"amount_minor\": 70000,\n        \"currency\": \"EUR\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"budget\": \"700.00 EUR\",\n  \"note\": \"The pay_order step requires human approval before execution\"\n}\n```\n\nThis plan will:\n1. **Search** for economy flights from Munich (MUC) to Frankfurt (FRA) on 2026-10-14\n2. **Select** the best available flight from the search results\n3. **Book** the selected flight (placing a hold on it)\n4. **Pay** for the order with 700.00 EUR (70000 cents)\n\nPlease approve this plan to proceed."
